    <h1>Graph-Based Recommendations with Personalized PageRank</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">HW6 assignment: build a user–movie bipartite graph, propagate personalized PageRank with TensorFlow.js, and compare popularity, global PageRank, PPR and matrix factorization on a shared evaluation cohort.</p>
    <p class="note">The graph is built from positive training interactions only; an unobserved rating is missing data, not a zero.</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <p id="status" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading…</p>

    <section aria-labelledby="tf-status-heading" class="panel">
      <h2 id="tf-status-heading">TensorFlow.js status</h2>
      <p id="tf-status" class="status-line" role="status" aria-live="polite">Loading TensorFlow.js…</p>
      <p id="backend-note" class="hint" role="status" aria-live="polite">No backend reported yet. Backend and runtime are recorded, not compared across devices.</p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="dataset-summary-heading" class="panel">
      <h2 id="dataset-summary-heading">Dataset summary</h2>
      <div id="dataset-summary-body" role="status" aria-live="polite">
        <p class="empty-state">Loading dataset…</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="graph-summary-heading" class="panel">
      <h2 id="graph-summary-heading">Graph summary</h2>
      <div id="graph-summary-body" role="status" aria-live="polite">
        <p class="empty-state">No graph yet. Press “Build graph” to report nodes, edges, zero-degree users, zero-degree movies and positive training interactions.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="controls-heading" class="panel">
      <h2 id="controls-heading">Controls</h2>

      <div class="control-grid control-grid--two">
