description: "Use when a Codex task contains multiple concrete, bounded implementation, refactor, or migration units that can proceed independently across files, modules, or test suites. Provides divide-and-conquer decomposition, parallel agent delegation, coordination, integration, and verification. Do not use for single-file edits, debug loops, exploratory investigation, or tightly coupled changes that require shared context throughout. Triggers: 'multi-unit task', 'refactor across files', 'split this work', 'parallel implementation', 'delegate this task'."
